{
  "sections": {
    "hero": {
      "type": "custom-liquid",
      "settings": {
        "custom_liquid": "<section class=\"q-hero q-wrap\">\n  <div class=\"q-hero__meta q-mono\"><span>Physalis Lab · 2026</span><span>Santiago — Global</span><span>Vol. 02</span></div>\n  <div class=\"q-hero__grid\">\n    <h1>Diseño <em>de autor</em><br>en tu hogar.</h1>\n    <div class=\"q-hero__art\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></div>\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"q-hero__foot\">\n    <p class=\"q-hero__tag\">Piezas únicas de diseñadores independientes de todo el mundo, impresas una por una en nuestro taller en Chile.</p>\n    <a href=\"/collections/all\" class=\"button\" style=\"text-decoration:none;\">Ver catálogo</a>\n  </div>\n</section>"
      }
    },
    "poster": {
      "type": "custom-liquid",
      "settings": {
        "custom_liquid": "<section class=\"q-poster\">\n  <div class=\"q-poster__grid\">\n    <div class=\"q-poster__art\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></div>\n    <div class=\"q-poster__info\">\n      <p class=\"q-mono q-poster__num\">Objeto nº 001 · Edición abierta</p>\n      <h2>Onda <em>.</em></h2>\n      <p class=\"q-poster__desc\">Un cuenco nacido del movimiento del agua al salir del torno. La curva se quedó por decisión, no por accidente.</p>\n      <dl class=\"q-poster__ficha\">\n        <dt>Autor</dt><dd>Amaya Studio · Lima, PE</dd>\n        <dt>Material</dt><dd>PLA vegetal 100%</dd>\n        <dt>Dimensiones</dt><dd>18 × 18 × 7 cm</dd>\n        <dt>Precio</dt><dd><strong style=\"color:#D9491C;\">$32.900 CLP</strong></dd>\n      </dl>\n      <a href=\"/collections/all\" class=\"button button--primary\" style=\"text-decoration:none;align-self:flex-start;\">Añadir al carro</a>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</section>"
      }
    },
    "categorias": {
      "type": "custom-liquid",
      "settings": {
        "custom_liquid": "<section class=\"q-cats q-wrap\">\n  <div class=\"q-cats__head\">\n    <p class=\"q-mono\" style=\"color:#D9491C;\">— El catálogo</p>\n    <h2>Objetos <em>primitivos</em> para usos cotidianos.</h2>\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"q-cats__grid\">\n    <a class=\"q-cat\" href=\"/collections/lamparas\">\n      <div class=\"q-cat__art\" style=\"background:#C48538;\">\n        <svg viewBox=\"0 0 100 125\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMidYMid meet\" style=\"position:absolute;inset:0;width:100%;height:100%;\"><circle cx=\"50\" cy=\"48\" r=\"28\" fill=\"#F2ECE0\"/><rect x=\"46\" y=\"72\" width=\"8\" height=\"36\" fill=\"#1A1814\"/><rect x=\"30\" y=\"106\" width=\"40\" height=\"4\" fill=\"#1A1814\"/></svg>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"q-cat__label\"><strong>Lámparas</strong><span>→</span></div>\n    </a>\n    <a class=\"q-cat\" href=\"/collections/floreros\">\n      <div class=\"q-cat__art\" style=\"background:#E8B49E;\">\n        <svg viewBox=\"0 0 100 125\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMidYMid meet\" style=\"position:absolute;inset:0;width:100%;height:100%;\"><path d=\"M38 40 Q30 70 34 110 L66 110 Q70 70 62 40 Z\" fill=\"#1A1814\"/><rect x=\"40\" y=\"30\" width=\"20\" height=\"10\" fill=\"#1A1814\"/></svg>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"q-cat__label\"><strong>Floreros</strong><span>→</span></div>\n    </a>\n    <a class=\"q-cat\" href=\"/collections/maceteros\">\n      <div class=\"q-cat__art\" style=\"background:#D9491C;\">\n        <svg viewBox=\"0 0 100 125\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMidYMid meet\" style=\"position:absolute;inset:0;width:100%;height:100%;\"><path d=\"M30 50 L70 50 L65 110 L35 110 Z\" fill=\"#F2ECE0\"/><path d=\"M30 50 Q50 20 70 50\" fill=\"#1A1814\"/></svg>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"q-cat__label\"><strong>Maceteros</strong><span>→</span></div>\n    </a>\n  </div>\n</section>"
      }
    },
    "kanji": {
      "type": "custom-liquid",
      "settings": {
        "custom_liquid": "<section class=\"q-kanji\">\n  <div class=\"q-wrap q-kanji__grid\">\n    <div>\n      <p class=\"q-mono\" style=\"color:#D9491C;margin:0;\">材 · Materia</p>\n      <p class=\"q-kanji__char\">揺らぎ</p>\n      <p class=\"q-mono\" style=\"opacity:0.55;\">Yuragi — la vibración de lo hecho a mano</p>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"q-kanji__right\">\n      <p class=\"q-mono\" style=\"color:#D9491C;margin:0;\">— Proceso</p>\n      <h3>Cada pieza vibra <em>un poco distinto.</em></h3>\n      <p>Imprimir bajo pedido significa que no hay dos piezas idénticas. La luz, la temperatura del taller, el lote del filamento — todo deja huella en la materia.</p>\n      <p>En japonés existe una palabra para esa sutil variación. Nosotros la llamamos firma.</p>\n      <a href=\"/pages/como-funciona\" class=\"button\" style=\"text-decoration:none;display:inline-block;margin-top:0.5rem;\">Cómo se imprime</a>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</section>"
      }
    },
    "archivo": {
      "type": "custom-liquid",
      "settings": {
        "custom_liquid": "<section class=\"q-archivo q-wrap\">\n  <div class=\"q-archivo__head\">\n    <div>\n      <p class=\"q-mono\" style=\"color:#D9491C;\">— El archivo</p>\n      <h2>Desliza <span class=\"q-serif-it\">y elige.</span></h2>\n    </div>\n    <a href=\"/collections/all\" class=\"q-mono\" style=\"text-decoration:underline;text-decoration-thickness:1px;text-underline-offset:6px;color:#1A1814;\">Ver todo →</a>\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"q-archivo__scroll\">\n    <div class=\"q-archivo__track\">\n      {%- assign items = 'Cuenco Onda|Amaya Studio|Lima|$32.900|product-demo-1.jpg|#E8B49E,Florero Tallo|Bruno Vega|Buenos Aires|$28.500|product-demo-2.jpg|#C48538,Lámpara Lumi|Mei Chen|Taipei|$46.900|product-demo-3.jpg|#F2ECE0,Macetero Vértice|Kasia Nowak|Varsovia|$22.400|product-demo-4.jpg|#D9491C,Vasija Ágora|Lorenzo Ricci|Milán|$41.200|product-demo-5.jpg|#6B1E10' | split: ',' -%}\n      {%- for i in items -%}\n        {%- assign p = i | split: '|' -%}\n        <a class=\"q-pc\" href=\"/collections/all\">\n          <div class=\"q-pc__frame\" style=\"background:{{ p[5] }};\"><img src=\"{{ p[4] | asset_url }}\" alt=\"{{ p[0] }}\" loading=\"lazy\"></div>\n          <div class=\"q-pc__meta\"><strong>{{ p[0] }}</strong><span>{{ p[3] }}</span></div>\n          <p class=\"q-pc__author\">{{ p[1] }} · {{ p[2] }}</p>\n        </a>\n      {%- endfor -%}\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</section>"
      }
    },
    "coda": {
      "type": "custom-liquid",
      "settings": {
        "custom_liquid": "<section class=\"q-coda q-wrap\">\n  <p class=\"q-mono\" style=\"color:#D9491C;\">— Próximo número</p>\n  <h2>Invierno '26: <em>objetos que envejecen bien.</em></h2>\n  <p>Recibe los lanzamientos y las notas del taller antes que nadie. Sin spam, una vez al mes.</p>\n  {%- form 'customer' -%}\n    <input type=\"hidden\" name=\"contact[tags]\" value=\"newsletter\">\n    <div class=\"q-coda__form\">\n      <input type=\"email\" name=\"contact[email]\" required placeholder=\"tu@email.com\">\n      <button type=\"submit\">Suscribirme →</button>\n    </div>\n  {%- endform -%}\n</section>"
      }
    }
  },
  "order": [
    "hero",
    "poster",
    "categorias",
    "kanji",
    "archivo",
    "coda"
  ]
}
